================================================================================
SECTION 1: PROJECT OVERVIEW
================================================================================

A standalone single-HTML-file application that automatically generates
timeline graphs from Excel data, visualizing machine breakdown events with
color-coded highlighting based on negative-word detection in the Impact field.

Target Users  : Process engineers and manufacturing plant operators
Primary Use   : Shopfloor breakdown event visualization
Delivery Form : Single .html file, no installation required


================================================================================
SECTION 2: PROJECT SCOPE
================================================================================

2.1 Core Features
-----------------
  - Single HTML file (standalone, no installation needed)
  - Excel file upload with header-name-based column detection
  - Automatic date/time format detection and normalization
  - Automatic timeline graph generation using HTML5 Canvas
  - PNG export via native Canvas API (canvas.toBlob())
  - Multi-line timeline layout with fixed event-per-line rule
  - Color-coded visualization:
      RED markers for Impact containing negative keywords
      Default (BLUE) markers for all other events
  - "Load Demo Data" button with embedded sample events

2.2 Out of Scope
----------------
  - Data editing within the application
  - Database storage or cloud saving
  - User authentication
  - External sample-data.xlsx deliverable (replaced by embedded demo)


