6.2 Event Card Display Format
-------------------------------
  Each event marker displays in this vertical order:

    ABOVE the axis:
      Date and Time label  (e.g., 2024-04-01  09:30)

    ON the axis:
      Marker dot  (● RED or BLUE depending on Impact keyword detection)

    BELOW the axis (inside the info card, top to bottom):
      Event   : [event description text]
      Impact  : [impact text]           <- RED bg + WHITE text
                                           if negative words found
                                        <- GRAY bg + BLACK text
                                           if no negative words found
      By Whom : [name]

